INSERT INTO `s630d_mdata` VALUES
(1,6,1,'Useful tips & information ','[message]Hello GajahMada,\n\nThank you for registering on our server.\n\nSince the 06.10.2026 at 14:09, Romans, Gauls, Teutons, Huns, Egyptians, Spartans and Vikings are competing for supremacy on this game world. Right now, 1 players in 0 Alliances are fighting for dominance. To not get lost in this devastating battle, you should look for allies even though you are <b>protected by beginner&#39;s protection for 72 hours</b>.\n\nThe taskmaster will help you on your way to establishing your empire with advice, deeds and resources (after a few tasks such as finding out the exact duration of your beginner&#39;s protection). You can find him on the right side of your village. After successfully completing all of his tasks you will be on your own again.\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li>You have to heed the <a href=\"rules.php\">game rules</a></li>\n<li>Information concerning troops and buildings can be found in the <a href=\"#\" onClick=\"return Popup(0,0);\">instructions</a></li>\n<li>Problems? Check the <a href=\"http://t3.answers.travianz.org\" target=\"_blank\">Travian Answers</a> first!</li>\n<li>No solution? Try asking in the <a href=\"https://github.com/Shadowss/TravianZ\">Forum</a></li>\n<li>Tried everything to no avail? Write an answer to this message to contact the Support</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>Game World Timeline</b>\n\nThis game world is expected to run until approximately <b>18.08.2027 11:38</b>. The estimated end date is calculated dynamically, following the timeline below, plus an additional <b>5 days</b> to allow for final attacks and possible World Wonder setbacks.\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li><b>Natars appear:</b> 23.06.2027 14:09</li>\n<li><b>World Wonder villages appear:</b> 23.06.2027 14:09</li>\n<li><b>World Wonder Construction Plans appear:</b> 23.06.2027 14:09</li>\n<li><b>World Wonder build time (level 0 &rarr; 100):</b> 50 days, 21 hours, 29 minutes</li>\n<li><b>Estimated World Wonder completion:</b> 13.08.2027 11:38</li>\n<li><b>Estimated world end date:</b> 18.08.2027 11:38</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>Natars</b>\n\nAfter approximately <b>approximately 8.5 months</b>, the <b>legendary tribe of the Natars</b> will enter the battlefield. Prepare your armies, strengthen your alliances and get ready for the final stage of the game.\n\n<b>Active Server Features</b>\n\nThe following features are currently active on this game world:\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\"><li>T4 Hero System</li><li>Huns</li><li>Egyptians</li><li>Spartans</li><li>Vikings</li><li>WW Image by Tribe</li></ul>\n\nWhen you delete your account or a game world ends you can move remaining gold to another account, if applicable. The details will be explained to you in an e-mail.\n\nRegards, TravianZ[/message]',0,0,0,1791333307,0,0,0,0,0,0),
(2,7,1,'Useful tips & information ','[message]Hello nusa,\n\nThank you for registering on our server.\n\nSince the 06.10.2026 at 14:09, Romans, Gauls, Teutons, Huns, Egyptians, Spartans and Vikings are competing for supremacy on this game world. Right now, 2 players in 0 Alliances are fighting for dominance. To not get lost in this devastating battle, you should look for allies even though you are <b>protected by beginner&#39;s protection for 72 hours</b>.\n\nThe taskmaster will help you on your way to establishing your empire with advice, deeds and resources (after a few tasks such as finding out the exact duration of your beginner&#39;s protection). You can find him on the right side of your village. After successfully completing all of his tasks you will be on your own again.\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li>You have to heed the <a href=\"rules.php\">game rules</a></li>\n<li>Information concerning troops and buildings can be found in the <a href=\"#\" onClick=\"return Popup(0,0);\">instructions</a></li>\n<li>Problems? Check the <a href=\"http://t3.answers.travianz.org\" target=\"_blank\">Travian Answers</a> first!</li>\n<li>No solution? Try asking in the <a href=\"https://github.com/Shadowss/TravianZ\">Forum</a></li>\n<li>Tried everything to no avail? Write an answer to this message to contact the Support</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>Game World Timeline</b>\n\nThis game world is expected to run until approximately <b>18.08.2027 11:38</b>. The estimated end date is calculated dynamically, following the timeline below, plus an additional <b>5 days</b> to allow for final attacks and possible World Wonder setbacks.\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n<li><b>Natars appear:</b> 23.06.2027 14:09</li>\n<li><b>World Wonder villages appear:</b> 23.06.2027 14:09</li>\n<li><b>World Wonder Construction Plans appear:</b> 23.06.2027 14:09</li>\n<li><b>World Wonder build time (level 0 &rarr; 100):</b> 50 days, 21 hours, 29 minutes</li>\n<li><b>Estimated World Wonder completion:</b> 13.08.2027 11:38</li>\n<li><b>Estimated world end date:</b> 18.08.2027 11:38</li>\n</ul>\n\n<b>Natars</b>\n\nAfter approximately <b>approximately 8.5 months</b>, the <b>legendary tribe of the Natars</b> will enter the battlefield. Prepare your armies, strengthen your alliances and get ready for the final stage of the game.\n\n<b>Active Server Features</b>\n\nThe following features are currently active on this game world:\n\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\"><li>T4 Hero System</li><li>Huns</li><li>Egyptians</li><li>Spartans</li><li>Vikings</li><li>WW Image by Tribe</li></ul>\n\nWhen you delete your account or a game world ends you can move remaining gold to another account, if applicable. The details will be explained to you in an e-mail.\n\nRegards, TravianZ[/message]',1,0,0,1791336333,0,0,0,0,0,0),
